    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rarely does a contemporary house come with a garage and plenty of storage and offer this combination — space, light, versatility and an unbeatable location. \r\n\r\nThis superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom family home, arranged over three levels, is one of the standout properties to come to market in Belmayne.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the quality and thoughtful layout are immediately apparent, with new flooring, decor and furniture throughout. True walk-in condition!\r\n\r\nThe garage is a genuine highlight — and a rare find in newer houses. With space for two cars and a remote-control door, it simultaneously offers extraordinary scope for creative use: \r\n\r\n- home office\r\n- home gym\r\n- yoga studio\r\n- home cinema\r\n- man cave with bar\r\n- art studio\r\n- playroom or gaming room\r\n- recording studio\r\n\r\nThe possibilities are endless. \r\n\r\nTo the rear of the garage is a laundry room with washer dryer, extra cupboard and work top space with access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe first floor living room spans the full width of the house, bathed in natural light through south-facing windows. To the rear, a generous kitchen and dining area opens onto a sunny balcony — perfect for evening dining — with a practical larder/store room alongside. A WC completes this floor.\r\n\r\nThree well-proportioned bedrooms and three bathrooms, including a master en-suite, complete the upper levels, making this an ideal home for families and  alike.\r\n\r\nOutside, the private rear garden provides a secure and peaceful setting for relaxing or entertaining, with a lawn, garden shed and access from both the laundry room and the kitchen balcony stairs.\r\n\r\nSet in the heart of the popular Belmayne community, the location is exceptional. Clare Hall Shopping Centre, Tesco, Lidl, Dunnes Stores, cafés, restaurants, gyms, childcare facilities, schools and local sports clubs are all close at hand. Clongriffin DART Station is within walking distance, with excellent Dublin Bus connections — including the 15 route — and swift access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport. Malahide, Portmarnock and Howth are all easily reachable.\r\n\r\nWith a B3 energy rating, gas-fired central heating and approximately 150 sq m of accommodation, this is a home that truly delivers on every front.\r\n\r\n**Viewing is highly recommended.**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
