        "Content": "Garage - 9.96m x 3.37m \r\n\r\n\r\nLaundry Room - 1.47m x 4.74m \r\n\r\n\r\nDining Area - 3.79m x 2.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.21m x 2.59m \r\n\r\n\r\nWC - 1.56m x 1.63m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.8m x 3.29m \r\n\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 4.19m x 3.29m \r\n\r\n\r\nEn-suite - 1.4m x 1.69m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.27m x 3.53m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.44m x 2.37m \r\n\r\n\r\nFamily bathroom - 2.25m x 1.86m \r\n\r\n\r\nGarden - 9.32m x 5.01m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
